  <p id="c-liangshu-009-cao-jingzong-zhangchong:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-liangshu-009-cao-jingzong-zhangchong:p001:m0000" ref="a02_614_f84_A">曹景宗</persName>，字<persName id="c-liangshu-009-cao-jingzong-zhangchong:p001:m0005" ref="a02_614_f84_A">子震</persName>，新野人也。父<persName id="c-liangshu-009-cao-jingzong-zhangchong:p001:m0014" ref="a02_614_f84">欣之</persName>，爲宋將，位至征虜將軍、徐州刺史。</p>
